# JustAC local pin: upstream ships no SimulationCraft list for this spec. The damage a
# Restoration Shaman does between heals, grounded at client build 12.1.0.69875.
# Resto's damage kit is small: Flame Shock (the spec's own cast, 470411), Lava Burst (two
# charges with Echo of the Elements; Lava Surge resets it, which the cooldown gate already
# sees), Chain Lightning, Lightning Bolt, and Frost Shock on the move. No hero tree adds a
# damage button for this spec, so there are no hero branches. Primordial Wave, Ascendance,
# Unleash Life, Healing Rain / Surging Totem and the Swiftness cooldowns are heals or belong
# to healing and are left out; buffs, imbues and shields are handled elsewhere.

# 3+ enemies clustered on the target: Chain Lightning leads (Blizzard puts it above Flame Shock).
actions=chain_lightning,if=spell_targets.chain_lightning>=3
# Keep Flame Shock up: Lava Burst always crits on a Flame Shocked target, and its ticks feed Lava Surge.
actions+=/flame_shock,if=refreshable
# Lava Burst on cooldown, and whenever Lava Surge resets it; spend charges, don't cap them.
actions+=/lava_burst
actions+=/lightning_bolt
actions+=/frost_shock,moving=1
